    {
      "type": "updated",
      "source": "wgmods",
      "sourceId": "7512",
      "title": "WoTVSWAPS",
      "previous": {
        "modVersion": "1.8",
        "wotGameVersion": "2.4.0.0",
        "fileName": "WotVSWAPS-V1.8.zip",
        "updatedAt": "2026-09-12T04:39:02.943Z",
        "changeLog": "Global update : greatly optimized file size thanks to a new technique, increases game performance.\nI added more goofy swaps because I felt like they were missing in lower tiers :D\nnotable changes :\n\nfixed stug III G getting swapped instead of stug III B\nadded Gendron (goofy swap)\nAdded M4A1 FL 10 back\nsome scripts unfortunately don't work anymore since the new 2.4 update, I will update as soon as possible.\nadded UE 57 rocket\nKV1 now has a more noticable derp\nKV2 changed to lesta 3D style\nall T34-85 variants had a change\nlow tier guns like the SU-85 and more have had their gun swapped \nadded the first of the czech tanks\nOverhauled Mitsu_108's gun\nadded P26/40\nHetzer mega derp\n"
      },
      "current": {
        "modVersion": "1.8.1",
        "wotGameVersion": "2.4.0.0",
        "fileName": "WotVSWAPS-V1.8.1.zip",
        "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T14:58:31.798Z",
        "changeLog": "FIxed all issue on M4A1 FL 10 (Tracks clipping on middle parts of the VCS hull, lights clipping, and back pannel,  misalignment with the turret, only issue that resides is tracks clipping with the front, but not very noticeable)\n\nAdded Excalibur, it now has rocks on it and a sword plunged in its hull to honor it's name\nreplaced T-26 with T-26 CN bc f russian texs\nFixed an issue with the 130mm gun barrel of the E-100 was painted whereas the rest of the tank was not\nAdded 113 black and white serpent style from lesta\nBison now looks like Karl Gerat (Gun won't move, purely hilarious)\nremoved hetzer\nAdded SU-85B remodel\n\n"
      }
    },
